msgid "<0>Individual Apartment Improvements (IAIs):</0> A landlord may be able to increase the legal rent when they make certain improvements or install new equipment in an apartment. The amount and requirements for an IAI depend on when the increase took effect and other factors. Current law places limits on the amount and frequency of IAI increases."
